OL,3,AMenopausal women pose as men to buy
OL,4,Atestosterone online after prescription
OL,5,Adifficulties
OL,6,
OL,7,FWomen are posing as men to buy
OL,8,Ftestosterone from online pharmacies
OL,9,Fbecause of difficulties getting NHS
OL,10,Fprescriptions in Wales, according to a
OL,11,Fconsultant.
OL,13,FThere has been a "very sharp increase"
OL,14,Fin testosterone referrals to the NHS
OL,15,Ffor post-menopausal women, but access
OL,16,Fvaries between health boards.
OL,18,FMenopause specialist Dr Michelle Olver
OL,19,Fsaid she had seen women with up to 12
OL,20,Ftimes the safe level of the hormone -
OL,21,Frisking permanent side effects -
OL,22,Fbecause they have bought online.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
